more palindromes than da potato pad<br></li><li>cryptic secret areas<br></li><li>very belated followup to ancient indie platformer &quot;Lyle in Cube Sector&quot;</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The unauthorized, kid-friendly version of the classic Stephen King thriller (or maybe not, maybe it's just a game about one-horned goatbabies)",
